    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "reconnect with my purpose? how... there's nothing left to connect to. everything i loved is just dust and ashes. i feel like a hollow shell. even if i found some 'spark', what is it for? just to watch everything else die slowly? it feels like the only thing i have left is this immense, heavy emptiness.",
