      "content": "resilience... it sounds so hollow. everyone i cared about is gone, and i'm just left here, dragging this broken body through a world that doesn't want me anymore. it doesn't feel like strength, it just feels like being punished by staying alive. if everything is gone, then what's the point of all this endurance? it just feels like a long, slow way to suffer. what am i even holding onto?",
